],"variant":true},{"levels":[[{"surface":"عمار مولى بني هاشم","kind":"narrator"},{"surface":"طلق بن حبيب","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"ابن عباس","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]],"variant":true},{"levels":[[{"surface":"معقل الخثعمي","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"علي","kind":"narrator","occurrence":2}]],"variant":true},{"levels":[[{"surface":"الشعبي","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"قمير امرأة مسروق","kind":"narrator"}],[{"surface":"عائشة","kind":"narrator","occurrence":3}]],"variant":true}],"shared_tail":null,"needs_ruling":false,"notes":["Main route (saying 1): the chain ends at Fatima bint Abi Hubaysh, whose account gives the Prophet's order; «أو أسماء حدثتني» is an alternative transmitter for the same saying, a variant.","Saying 2 (Sawda's case, «إذا مضت أيامها اغتسلت وصلت») is a different act with its own isnad, so it is a labelled non-variant group (rule 4a). Every other «روى» or «رواه» names another transmitter for the same ruling: variant groups.","The compiler's own remarks («قال أبو داود», the opinions list, the «وهم من ابن عيينة» judgement) and the footnote numerals are left out."],"fixes":[]}
